# WeChat Gemini Edition - Optimized for Overseas Accounts
# Last Updated: 2026-10-08
# This ruleset is designed for Loon / Subconverter / OpenClash / Karing.
# Import this list and assign it to a PROXY (Singapore / Overseas) policy group.

#[Rule]
# =======================================================
# I. Core WeChat Services (for PROXY policy)
# Essential domains for international account messaging, data sync, and OAuth.
# =======================================================
DOMAIN-SUFFIX, wechat.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX, wechatlegal.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX, wechatos.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX, wechatopen.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX, wechatpay.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX, wechatpay.cn

# =======================================================
# II. Tencent Cloud Overseas IP Segments (for PROXY policy)
# Anycast & BGP CIDRs (Singapore/HK/Global) to intercept HTTP-DNS bypass traffic.
# Using 'no-resolve' prevents local DNS reverse lookup latency.
# =======================================================
IP-CIDR, 101.32.0.0/16, no-resolve
IP-CIDR, 129.226.0.0/16, no-resolve
IP-CIDR, 150.109.0.0/16, no-resolve
IP-CIDR, 203.205.0.0/16, no-resolve
IP-CIDR, 43.152.0.0/16, no-resolve
IP-CIDR, 43.153.0.0/16, no-resolve
IP-CIDR, 43.156.0.0/16, no-resolve
